# AGENT RULES & CONSTRAINTS

- Strictly follow TypeScript Strict Mode. No `any` types.
- Never write pseudocode or leave `// TODO` placeholders. Generate complete, runnable files.
- Build strictly ONE feature at a time and wait for explicitly requested phase sign-off.
- Prioritize simplicity, hackathon-demo viability, and clean code over over-engineering.
- Maintain a dark-mode, glassmorphism fintech aesthetic (Stripe/Linear/Vercel hybrid).